"Register your logo with Mastercard","24391","<p>As of April 16, 2021, it is required to register the digital logo of your business on the Mastercard microsite. In addition to the registration of the logo, when you log in to the microsite, Mastercard will request additional information about your business such as contact information and physical address.</p><p>By sharing your business logo with Mastercard, your customers benefit from greater transaction transparency, reduced cardholder billing disputes, and your business benefit from increased brand presence each time a cardholder views a purchase. Merchants can share their digital logos with Mastercard at no charge.</p>		
