"Meet one of our leaders: Ana Laura Olmos","27316","<p><strong>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</strong></p><p>Meet one of our leaders:<br />ANA LAURA OLMOS is Evertec's Marketing and Communications Manager for Latin America.</p><p>She has more than 14 years of experience in the electronic payments and transactional processing industry as well as in fraud prevention and security areas. She currently leads communications and marketing for the Latin American markets where Evertec operates. Ana Laura has been recognized for her leadership and ability to always integrate local needs with the corporate objectives to better serve both internal and external clients.In her current role, Ana Laura manages a team distributed throughout the region in charge of positioning Evertec in Latin America by developing communications, participating and organizing events that allow sharing of Evertec's knowledge and experience in the payments business.</p><p>Before taking on her current role, she served as Communications and Marketing Manager at PayGroup, a company acquired by Evertec in 2017. Prior to that, she served as content editor for local publications in Uruguay. Ana Laura also participates as a mentor in the women's edition “Despegate” program, organized by CEDU (Chamber of the Digital Economy of Uruguay), which seeks to empower small and medium businesses by matching them with experts and business leaders.</p><p>She completed a master’s degree in Communications Management from the University of Montevideo, and has a Bachelor of Science in Social Communication from the Catholic University of Uruguay.</p><p><em>We are proud to have women like Ana Laura, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the third time in a row, in <a href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/en/evertec-named-to-bloombergs-gender-equality-index-for-third-consecutive-year/""><strong>Bloomberg’s Gender Equality Index</strong></a>. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.</em></p>",,"2021-05-28 11:02:24","meet-one-of-our-leaders-ana-laura-olmos","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/EN-Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:17:""Table of Contents"";}","","EN-Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada",,,,"EN-Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg","Externos",,,"en",,"Meet one of our leaders: Ana Laura Olmos",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Conoce a nuestras líderes: Ana Laura Olmos","27336","<p><strong>En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de género y desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro éxito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.</strong></p><p>Conoce a una de nuestras líderes:<br /><strong>ANA LAURA OLMOS</strong> es la gerente de Comunicaciones y Mercadeo para América Latina de Evertec.</p><p>Posee más de 14 años de experiencia en la industria de pagos electrónicos y procesamiento de transacciones, prevención de fraude y seguridad, liderando las comunicaciones y mercadeo en los diferentes mercados de Latinoamérica donde Evertec opera. Ana Laura se ha destacado en su liderazgo y en su capacidad de integrar siempre lo local con lo corporativo para servir mejor a clientes internos y externos.</p><p>En su rol actual, Ana Laura maneja un equipo distribuido por la región gestionando las estrategias de comunicaciones y mercadeo para dar a conocer y posicionar a Evertec en Latinoamérica, así como participar y organizar eventos que permitan compartir el conocimiento y experiencia de Evertec en el negocio.</p><p>Antes de ocupar su rol actual, ejerció como gerente de Comunicaciones y mercadeo en PayGroup, empresa adquirida por Evertec en 2017. Previo a esto se desempeñó como editora de contenidos en publicaciones locales de Uruguay. Ana Laura también participa como mentora del programa “Despegate” edición mujeres, organizado por CEDU (Cámara de la Economía Digital del Uruguay), en la que se busca potenciar a las pymes relacionándolas con expertas y líderes de negocio.</p><p>Realizó estudios de Maestría en Dirección de Comunicaciones de la Universidad de Montevideo, y es Licenciada en Ciencias de la Comunicación Social por la Universidad Católica del Uruguay.</p><p><em>Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Ana Laura, quienes demuestran que nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusión se integren en nuestras prácticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por tercera ocasión, en el <a href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/evertec-bloomberg-gei-tercer-ano/"">Índice de Igualdad de Género de Bloomberg</a>.</em></p>",,"2021-05-28 11:02:24","conoce-a-nuestras-lideres-ana-laura-olmos","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:17:""Table of Contents"";}","","Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada",,,,"Mujeres-lideres-Ana-Laura-Olmos-Portada.jpg","Externos",,,"es","Meet one of our leaders: Ana Laura Olmos","Conoce a nuestras líderes: Ana Laura Olmos",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Successful Evertec Strategy: Bet on Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion","27401","<p><i>Evertec is the clear example of how to integrate strategies aimed at this purpose; it is the key to achieving great business results. Proof of this is the company’s inclusion, for the third time, in <strong>Bloomberg’s Gender Equality Index</strong>, which highlights its commitment to and transparency in the promotion of women's equality within the organization.</i></p><p><strong>Bogotá, February 202</strong>1. Evertec, a leading company of transaction processing services in Latin America, stands out in the industry as an organization that features diversity, equity, and inclusion as its pillars.</p><p>Part of Evertec’s efforts is reflected in their positioning as an employer brand, by promoting several policies based on equity and gender diversity, free of prejudice and fostering an inclusive culture where women can occupy leadership roles, as well as anti-harassment policies. These have been effective tools that the corporation is proud of.</p><p>Recently, Evertec received the news that, for the third consecutive year, it would be included in Bloomberg’s Gender Equality Index, which identifies companies committed to transparency in the disclosure of gender-related reports and the promotion of women's equality. This index also measures gender equality based on five pillars: female leadership and talent pipeline, equal pay and gender pay parity, inclusive culture, sexual harassment policies, and pro-women brand.</p><p><i>“For Evertec, it is gratifying to see that all of the efforts that we promote within the company are reflected in the industry. Being included in this important index for the third time in a row shows us that our programs –focused on developing female talent through leadership roles– and our diversity efforts are on the right path”,</i> says Paola Pérez, Executive Vice-President and Evertec's main administrative officer lead in human resources management.</p><p>This is not the only aspect worth highlighting. As part of Evertec's commitment to women's growth within the organization, they held part of the <strong>Globant Awards - Women That Build Edition</strong>, an award that recognizes women who have made their careers in technology and manage innovation projects and collaborations. One of the five finalists for this award was Patricia Parrado, Technology Manager for Colombia, who stood out among a large number of participants due to her professional trajectory, academic training, leadership, and impact on the community.</p><p><i>“It is an honor for us that one of our leaders is part of this select group of women who have been recognized for their leadership skills and knowledge in the sector. This shows that women in Evertec can change the vision of the industry and greatly improve the company’s ideas”,</i> says Enrique Candanoza, Country Head of Evertec Colombia.</p><p>Evertec has two offices in Colombia, located in Bogotá and Medellín, that meet all of the pillars for which the organization is recognized.</p><p>The efforts made by Evertec to achieve this recognition include the following:</p><ul><li>Promote an inclusive culture among its employees.</li><li>Develop female talent through leadership roles.</li><li>Include policies to protect against, prevent, and address sexual harassment.</li><li>Integrate, as a brand hallmark, Evertec’s value as a pro-gender diversity and prejudice-free employer.</li></ul><p><br />37% of our employees are women, 26% of whom work in information technology, which is significant since it has been shown that the role of women in the technology industry is key to the development of the sector.</p><p>With these achievements in the field of gender equity, Evertec is reaffirmed as one of the leading companies to feature inclusion, not only at the national level but also globally, as an ideal path for business productivity and growth, something that has been evidenced through its figures.</p><p><b>About Evertec:<br /></b>Evertec (NYSE: EVTC), a leading transaction processing services company in Latin America, provides services for acquiring retail transactions, payment processing, and business process management. It manages a system of electronic payment networks that processes more than 2 billion transactions annually and provides an integral set of banking solutions processing services, cash processing, and technology outsourcing. In addition, Evertec possesses and operates <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/cajeros/"">the ATH<sup>®</sup> network</a>, one of the main PIN debit networks in Latin America. With headquarters in Puerto Rico, it offers services in 26 countries in Latin America. For more information, visit <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest"">www.evertecinc.com</a>.</p><p><b>Press contacts</b><br />Brenda Agosto<br />(787) 472-7633 / <a href=""mailto:brenda.agosto@dev.creativeteam.co"">brenda.agosto@dev.creativeteam.co</a></p><p>Alexandra López-Soler<br />Cel. (939) 400-6497 / <a href=""mailto:alexandra.lopez@dev.creativeteam.co"">alexandra.lopez@dev.creativeteam.co</a></p>","Bogotá, febrero de 2021. Evertec, una compañía líder de servicios de procesamiento de transacciones en América Latina se destaca dentro de la industria como una organización que ha puesto como eje del negocio la diversidad, equidad e inclusión. ","2021-03-05 15:17:04","successful-evertec-strategy-bet-on-diversity-equity-and-inclusion","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/03/Apostar-por-la-diversidad-evertec.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:1;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:2:{s:14:""_section_style"";a:1:{s:8:""_padding"";i:1;}s:19:""_section_background"";a:1