"Evertec is a participating organization of the PCI Council","27574","<p>The <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">PCI SSC</a><em> (Payment Card Industry Security Standards Council) is an open world forum with the objective of formulating, improving, storing, disseminating, and applying all of the necessary security standards to guarantee the protection of account data.</em></p><p>In turn, the <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.pcisecuritystandards.org/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">PCI SSC</a> is the Council that defines the security standards consisting of physical, logical and administrative controls (PCI DSS) to meet this objective. In the PCI Council, any processor or service provider dedicated to processing, storing, or transmitting payment card data, is required to comply with the standards previously agreed upon.</p><p>As a participating organization, <strong>Evertec</strong> plays a relevant role in the continuous development of PCI security standards, as it brings together a global network of almost 800 companies in more than 60 countries and collaborates in the assurance of standards that are implemented globally to secure payment data.</p><p>In addition, by being a member, <strong>Evertec</strong> can participate in the annual PCI meetings, which benefits its customers in the implementation of early knowledge and adaptation of the new standards that arise in the Council. In this way, <strong>Evertec</strong> plays a key role, facing its customers, increasing data security, and staying at the forefront of payments processing technology.</p>","Evertec®, como compañía líder en tecnología y transacciones electrónicas y de procesamiento de pagos en América Latina, está plenamente comprometido con el cumplimiento de normativas y estándares de la industria financiera y sigue reafirmando su compromiso al ser una organización participante del Consejo de PCI desde el 2019.","2020-05-26 23:55:37","evertec-is-a-participating-organization-of-the-pci-council","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-es-Organizacion-participante-del-Consejo-de-PCI-evertec.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","banner-Evertec-es-Organización-participante-del-Consejo-de-PCI-evertec",,,,"banner-Evertec-es-Organizacion-participante-del-Consejo-de-PCI-evertec.jpg","Noticias",,,"en","Evertec es organización participante del Consejo de PCI","Evertec is a participating organization of the PCI Council",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo","27584","<p>SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO– Evertec, Inc., leader in payment transactions processing services in Latin America and specialized in monitoring and fraud management, announced today its agreement with <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""https://www.alelo.com.br/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Alelo</a>, a brand specialized in benefits, incentives, and corporate expenditure management, which acts as a member Business and businesses, offering a better experience to cardholders.</p><p>Founded in 2003, <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""https://www.alelo.com.br/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Alelo</a> has more than fifteen years of experience in the market, and since 2013, it has been a leader in the benefit sector through <strong>the Workers’ Food Program</strong> (PAT) of the Ministry of Labor (MPT). It has more than 130,000 customer-centric companies, 8 million users, and more than 600 thousand affiliated businesses in Brazil.</p><p><strong>Mac Schuessler, president and CEO of Evertec, indicated</strong>: “We are pleased with the trust placed by <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""https://www.alelo.com.br/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Alelo</a> in Evertec. This agreement is significant due to the important role that <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""https://www.alelo.com.br/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Alelo</a> has in the Brazilian market. In 2018, <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""https://www.alelo.com.br/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Alelo</a> processed over 600 million transactions only in its workers’ program. This is a great testimony of the continuous adoption of our technology throughout Latin America.”</p><p>Adriano Tchen, Alelo’s CIO, stressed that “Choosing Evertec as a technological partner is the result of a profound analysis of the market, as well as the trust the company has earned during its time in Brazil. Evertec offers us a flexible and modular solution that will allow us to streamline the response times to our customers and, therefore, provide them with a better service.“</p>",,"2020-05-26 04:14:32","evertec-expands-its-presence-in-brazil-in-partnership-with-alelo","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-expande-su-presencia-en-Brasil-en-alianza-con-Alelo-evertec.jpg","standard","closed","closed",,"wp-post","3.14.1","3.14.1","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","banner-Evertec expande su presencia en Brasil en alianza con Alelo-evertec",,,,"banner-Evertec-expande-su-presencia-en-Brasil-en-alianza-con-Alelo-evertec.jpg","Historias de exito",,"Optional","en","Evertec expande su presencia en Brasil en alianza con Alelo","Evertec expands its presence in Brazil in partnership with Alelo",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
