"Evertec will be part of the eCommerce Day Tour 2021","27788","<p>The <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://ecommerceday.org/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">eCommerce Day</a> event has taken place since 2008 in different Latin American countries and aims to ""promote an area where companies in the online business world can exchange experiences and solutions, while also creating a collaborative channel."" (eCommerce Institute, 2021)</p><p>Learn more details about our participation, starting with <a style=""color: #f36e21; text-decoration: underline;"" href=""https://ecommerceday.org/eretail-day-mexico-online-live-experience/"">eCommerce Day in Mexico</a> from March 3rd to 5th, and do not miss our workshop: Hands to work! The step by step of a microsite / payment links to open your business to the world, with Johan Arango, operating manager of Evertec Medellín.</p><p> </p><p style=""text-align: center;"">Join us on the following dates!</p><p><img src=""data:image/png;base64,"" alt=""pastedGraphic.png"" /></p>",,"2021-02-26 12:47:20","evertec-will-be-part-of-the-ecommerce-day-tour-2021","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/02/eCommerce-dayTour-2021-1.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","eCommerce-dayTour-2021",,,,"eCommerce-dayTour-2021-1.png","Noticias",,,"en","Evertec será parte del eCommerce Day Tour 2021","Evertec will be part of the eCommerce Day Tour 2021",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Evertec and Compensar Launch the First Mobile Compensation Fund Wallet in Colombia","27802","<p>Bogotá, Colombia. This initiative, along with others that are being developed jointly, is aimed at enriching the transactional options of members, simplifying access to consultation and use of the resources listed in the plastic for members of the Fund.</p><p>The Mobile Wallet solution makes it easy for <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://corporativo.compensar.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Compensar</a> affiliates to carry out various transactions through their mobile without having to use their physical card. “<em>With this latest update, the goal is to speed up the adoption of the mobile tool to provide users with a more agile, more secure digital payment experience, and in a more comfortable way. This will provide more control over all their products and immediate access to the multiple benefits they have with partner establishments. It is about making possible a better payment alternative than those that already exist today for <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://corporativo.compensar.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Compensar</a> clients</em>,” said Enrique Candanoza, General Manager at Evertec Colombia.</p><p>The main benefits for users of this application which have been extended to <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://corporativo.compensar.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Compensar</a> affiliates are the following:</p><ul><li>Immediate fund availability</li><li>Transactions at no cost</li><li>Making payments in inhabited businesses through token, QR, and barcode codes</li><li>Visualization of movements of transactions carried out in the wallets and the available balance of each of these</li><li>Transfers between Compensar Card users</li><li>Mobile recharges to all mobile operators in Colombia</li><li>Availability 24 hours a day, 365 days a year</li></ul><p><br />With this new development, <strong>Evertec and <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://corporativo.compensar.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Compensar</a></strong> maintain and reinforce joint work, implementing initiatives that benefit users. “<em>To Compensar, this is a very important advance on the path towards service digitization, which will make it possible to increasingly facilitate access to resources for our affiliates. In the case of the mobile wallet, we improved the experience of consulting and using the products associated with the Compensar Card, which can now be used immediately through the app</em>,” assured Oscar Mario Ruiz, Director of the Financing and Alliances Unit at Compensar.</p><p>A decade of commercial relationships between<strong> Evertec and <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://corporativo.compensar.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Compensar</a></strong> has brought about various enriching experiences, which have cemented the solidity of both companies in the Colombian market. More than a service provider, <strong>Evertec is Compensar’s business partner</strong>, working together under the premise of knowing the needs and expectations of affiliates and users to develop suitable products and services according to their demands and adopting new technologies to improve customer experience.</p>","Evertec® y la Caja de Compensación Familiar Compensar (“Compensar”) afianzan su relación de negocio con el lanzamiento de la primera aplicación de billetera móvil para cajas de compensación en el país.","2020-05-26 00:27:40","evertec-and-compensar-launch-the-first-mobile-compensation-fund-wallet-in-colombia","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2020/05/banner-Evertec-y-Compensar-lanzan-primera-Billetera-Movil-de-Cajas-de-Compensacion-en-Colombia-evertec.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.2.3","3.2.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1: