"Merchants: Protect your customers' information by filling out the PCI Security Standards Council Self-Assessment questionnaire","28222","To meet the Payment Card Industry Data Security Standard, it is important to keep the Self-Assessment Questionnaire up-to-date and renew it each year. By completing the questionnaire and being compliant, you secure your customers’ sensitive information and reduce the possibility that such information is used fraudulently.
<h4>To complete the Self-Assessment Questionnaire, follow the instructions below:</h4>

<hr />

<strong>1.</strong> Go to <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://pciportal.gmsectec.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">GMST PCI Portal (gmsectec.com)</a>

<strong>2.</strong> Click on the Login button and enter your username and password.
<ul>
 	<li>If you cannot remember your password, click on ""Forgot password"" to reset it.</li>
 	<li>If you belong to a chain, call (787) 625-0055 or send an email to <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""mailto:pcihelpdesk@gmsectec.com"">pcihelpdesk@gmsectec.com</a> to provide your CHAIN access credentials</li>
 	<li>If you have not signed up yet, go to step 3.</li>
</ul>
<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/1para-completar-cuestionario-min-2.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/1para-completar-cuestionario-min-2-300x95.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/1para-completar-cuestionario-min-2-300x95.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/1para-completar-cuestionario-min-2.jpg 515w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""95"" /> </a>
<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min-300x284.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min-300x284.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min.jpg 471w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""284"" /> </a>

<strong>3.</strong> To register on the platform, follow these steps:
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/3-crear-inicio-de-sesion-min.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"" data-elementor-lightbox-title=""a. Click on the Create Login button."">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/3-crear-inicio-de-sesion-min-300x72.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/3-crear-inicio-de-sesion-min-300x72.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/3-crear-inicio-de-sesion-min.jpg 478w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""72"" /> </a><figcaption>a. Click on the Create Login button.</figcaption></figure>
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/4-ingresa-su-merchant-id-min.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"" data-elementor-lightbox-title=""b. Enter your Merchant ID and ZIP code and click on “Sign up.”"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/4-ingresa-su-merchant-id-min-300x96.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/4-ingresa-su-merchant-id-min-300x96.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/07/4-ingresa-su-merchant-id-min.jpg 474w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""96"" /> </a><figcaption>b. Enter your Merchant ID and ZIP code and click on “Sign up.”</figcaption></figure>
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-min.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"" data-elementor-lightbox-title=""c. On the registration screen, fill all fields and click on “Continue.”"" data-elementor-lightbox-description=""c. En la pantalla de registro, completa todos los campos y presiona Continuar."">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-min-300x240.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-min-300x240.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-min.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""240"" /> </a><figcaption>c. On the registration screen, fill all fields and click on “Continue.”</figcaption></figure>
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-b.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"" data-elementor-lightbox-title=""d. On the Pre-SAQ Questions tab, answer the questions to identify which type of SAQ you need to complete. If, on the contrary, you wish to select the type of SAQ manually, click on &quot;Manually Select the Self-Assessment Questionnaire.&quot;"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-b-300x86.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-b-300x86.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/5-preguntas-previas-b.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""86"" /> </a><figcaption>d. On the Pre-SAQ Questions tab, answer the questions to identify which type of SAQ you need to complete. If, on the contrary, you wish to select the type of SAQ manually, click on ""Manually Select the Self-Assessment Questionnaire.""</figcaption></figure>
<strong>4.</strong> On the main screen of the platform, click on “STEP 1” to create your electronic signature.
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2-300x242.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2-300x242.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""242"" /> </a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
<strong>5.</strong> Then click on “STEP 2” to complete your SAQ.
<figure><a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2-300x242.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2-300x242.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/7-paso2.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""242"" /> </a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>
6. Once the SAQ is completed and if it is compliant, the PCI compliance certificate will be sent to your email.
<h4>To renew your Self-Assessment Questionnaire, follow the instructions below:</h4>

<hr />

<strong>1.</strong> Go to <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://pciportal.gmsectec.com"">https://pciportal.gmsectec.com</a>.
<strong>2.</strong> Click on the Login button and enter your username and password.
<ul>
 	<li>If you cannot remember your password, click on ""Forgot password"" to reset it.</li>
</ul>
<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min-300x284.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min-300x284.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2021/06/2-iniciar-sesion-min.jpg 471w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""284"" /> </a>

<strong>3.</strong> Once you are on the main screen, identify and/or write down your SAQ type in STEP 2 of your Control Panel.

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/9-tipo-de-saq.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/9-tipo-de-saq-300x163.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/9-tipo-de-saq-300x163.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/9-tipo-de-saq.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""163"" /> </a>

<strong>4.</strong> Click on the SAQ Annual Validation button and then click on the Complete Validation button.

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/10-validacion-saq.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/10-validacion-saq-300x123.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/10-validacion-saq-300x123.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/10-validacion-saq.jpg 325w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""123"" /> </a>

<strong>5.</strong> In the pop-up message, click on the Convert to 3.2.1 Now button and click on “Manually Select the Self-Assessment Questionnaire.”

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/11-convert-to-321-now.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/11-convert-to-321-now-300x194.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/11-convert-to-321-now-300x194.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/11-convert-to-321-now.jpg 415w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""194"" /> </a>
<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/12-cambiar-tipo-de-cuestionario.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/12-cambiar-tipo-de-cuestionario-300x83.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/12-cambiar-tipo-de-cuestionario-300x83.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/12-cambiar-tipo-de-cuestionario.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""83"" /> </a>

<strong>6.</strong> In the list of SAQs, select the same type of questionnaire that you identified in STEP 3 and then click on “Update to SAQ 3.2.1 Above Selected.”

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/13-resumen.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/13-resumen-300x172.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/13-resumen-300x172.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/13-resumen.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""172"" /> </a>
<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/14-actualizar.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/14-actualizar-300x49.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/14-actualizar-300x49.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/14-actualizar.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""49"" /> </a>

<strong>7.</strong> The Portal will show you the requirements applicable to your SAQ and a message indicating that all the questions have been answered; click on “Next Requirement” until the end of the questionnaire.

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/15-saq-wizard.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/15-saq-wizard-300x124.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/15-saq-wizard-300x124.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/15-saq-wizard.jpg 500w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""124"" /> </a>

<strong>8.</strong> Click on “Finish” to finish your questionnaire and then click on “Complete Validation.”

<a href=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/16-terminar.jpg"" data-elementor-open-lightbox=""yes"">
<img src=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/16-terminar-300x61.jpg"" sizes=""(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px"" srcset=""https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/16-terminar-300x61.jpg 300w, https://stwpevtcstorage01.blob.core.windows.net/imagenes-portal/2020/09/16-terminar.jpg 425w"" alt="""" width=""300"" height=""61"" /> </a>

<strong>9.</strong> Upon successful completion of the questionnaire, you will be able to observe that the Portal will indicate that your SAQ is compliant for one year.

