"BancoEstado Project: The success of a payment and collection solution","29471","<p>A payment and collections solution that allows BancoEstado's customers to view and pay their accounts or services in real time, using the payment methods provided by the bank.</p><p><strong>BancoEstado<br /></strong>This company has positioned itself as an institution of excellence, with a commercial management of high social impact. Its most recent milestones include surpassing 13 million CuentaRUT accounts and extending the BancoEstado Express and Caja Vecina services throughout all the country's municipalities.</p><p><strong>Evertec<br /></strong>Leading payment technology company in Latin America and the Caribbean that provides a wide range of merchant transaction acquiring, issuer processing, payment digitization, and fraud prevention and monitoring services.</p>With over 166 years of experience in the market, BancoEstado has established itself in the delivery of financial services, coming closer to achieving its mission of being a public policy tool to support Chile as it advances towards its integral development. Its history of more than a century is based on the continuous development of projects and innovations intended to make it the most beloved company by Chileans and the best public bank in the world.		
												<img width=""700"" height=""257"" src=""/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/EN-infografia-banco-estado.jpg"" alt="""" loading=""lazy"" srcset=""/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/EN-infografia-banco-estado.jpg 700w, /wp-content/uploads/2021/07/EN-infografia-banco-estado-300x110.jpg 300w"" sizes=""(max-width: 700px) 100vw, 700px"" />														
		<h4>the challenge</h4><hr /><p><a style=""color: #f36e00;"" href=""http://www.bancoestado.cl"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">BancoEstado</a> is the only public bank in Chile, focused on promoting the development of national economic activities by providing banking and financial services throughout the country. In addition, given its public nature, one of BancoEstado's main functions has been the development of financial activities in various production and business sectors, which has driven its constant search for strategic partners to help connect its solutions and provide an optimal service to its customers.</p><p>This is how it initiated its relationship with <a style=""color: #f36e00;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/"">Evertec</a> in 2008, which offered the bank a solution to improve its collections service by integrating online payment capabilities, automating operational processes, and drastically reducing manual tasks. The challenge for this solution was to provide the bank with the technical capability to offer online payment capabilities service enabling the accounts of hundreds of companies that need to collect through different service channels. This done with a specialized and exclusive team reducing implementation times and costs for each new service offered.</p><p><a style=""color: #f36e00;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/"">Evertec</a> offered a multichannel collections solution through a <strong>Service HUB</strong>, which —in combination with BancoEstado's multichannel approach— helped integrate various merchants and bank customers who needed an efficient, real-time collections solution for the payment of accounts or services. And all of this provided through BancoEstado's various channels offering a variety of payment methods.</p><h4>summary of evertec's collections service:</h4><hr /><ul><li>The service integrates the <strong>full payment cycle</strong>, from the moment the merchant conveys the debt information and is notified of the payment, to the settlement and accounting of the payments made.</li><li>It offers an authorization system that allows for <strong>the rapid growth in the number of companies linked to the service</strong>, offering ample flexibility in their integration methods adapting to their systems.</li><li>It also provides configuration tools that <strong>allow users to modify the operating specifications under each agreement</strong>.</li><li>The service integrates bank collection channels like Caja Vecina, BancoEstado Express teller machines, the Web Portals and a Mobile Application for Individuals and Businesses, and any other channels the Bank decides to include in the future.</li></ul><h4>The partnership has been extended for 5 years</h4><p>Due to its quality of service and ongoing commitment, BancoEstado has renewed its contract with Evertec.</p><h4>results</h4><hr /><p>The result of this collection process was an <strong>increase in new businesses and linked customers</strong>. This led to an exponential growth in transaction volumes, which now exceed 7 million collection transactions per month. Some of the most important benefits obtained were an improvement in customer experience and in the response times of the implementation process for each service, a service that can be adapted to each customer's needs while being able to maintain the essence of the collections process.</p>","Solución de pago y recaudación, que permite a usuarios y clientes de BancoEstado consultar y pagar sus cuentas o servicios en tiempo real, utilizando los medios de pago habilitados por el banco.","2021-07-28 09:46:18","banco-estado-project-the-success-of-a-payment-and-collection-solution","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/05/caso-de-exito-banco-estado-evertec.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.14.1","3.14.1","default","builder",,"a:4:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:8;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:3:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:8;}}s:5:""style"";a:1:{s:13:""section_style"";a:1:{s:5:""align"";i:2;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:2:{s:14:""_section_style"";a:4:{s:8:""_padding"";i:1;s:7:""_margin"";i:1;s:14:""_element_width"";i:1;s:21:""_element_custom_width"";i:1;}s:19:""_section_background"";a:1:{s:22:""_background_background"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:5;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:3:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:5;}}s:5:""style"";a:1:{s:13:""section_style"";a:1:{s:21:""background_background"";i:3;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:1:{s:16:""section_advanced"";a:2:{s:6:""margin"";i:4;s:7:""padding"";i:3;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:3:{s:6:""layout"";a:2:{s:17:""section_structure"";a:1:{s:9:""structure"";i:2;}s:14:""section_layout"";a:1:{s:16:""content_position"";i:1;}}s:5:""style"";a:1:{s:18:""section_background"";a:1:{s:21:""background_background"";i:1;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:1:{s:16:""section_advanced"";a:2:{s:6:""margin"";i:1;s:7:""padding"";i:1;}}}}s:5:""image"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:13:""section_image"";a:1:{s:5:""image"";i:1;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:1:{s:14:""_section_style"";a:1:{s:7:""_margin"";i:1;}}}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:17:""Table of Contents"";}","","caso-de-exito-banco-estado-evertec",,,,"caso-de-exito-banco-estado-evertec.jpg","Historias de exito",,"Optional","en","Proyecto BancoEstado: El éxito de una solución de pagos y recaudación","BancoEstado Project: The success of a payment and collection solution",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Evertec and Social Media Group (Gustazos®) Market Launch of Gustitos®Go","29482","<p>Last June, Evertec and Social Media Group —creator of Gustazos® and leader in Puerto Rico in the field of digital marketing-based offers and discounts— released Gustitos®Go in the local market. This is a new loyalty program for ATH® users and merchants who use Evertec for processing on the island. Consumers who register in the program may accrue points from Gustazos.com (G-Credits™) for purchases in participating businesses.</p><p><em>""At Evertec, we are excited about this new program. It will certainly be an excellent tool to help local businesses grow their sales, while ATH cardholders get a new benefit by obtaining credits for purchasing everyday items at their favorite stores. It is an excellent way of continuing to strengthen Puerto Rico's businesses and economy,""</em> said Mike Vizcarrondo, Chief Commercial Officer at Evertec for Puerto Rico and the Caribbean.</p><p>GustitosGo is a loyalty program that awards points (G-Credits) to users registered through the Gustazos platform when they pay with their ATH card at participating businesses. After their ATH card has been properly registered in the program, when users make purchases at GustitosGo participating businesses, they receive G-Credits for the equivalent of 7% of their total purchase, and if they make a second purchase at the same participating business during the same month, they get 12%, as per the participation rules established by GustitosGo. These G-Credits may be redeemed at www.Gustazos.com.</p><p>Luke C. Todesco, CEO of Social Media Group, stated that <em>""this partnership between Gustazos and Evertec is a continuation of a long-standing and successful collaboration aimed at helping to make the everyday life of Puerto Rico's residents and businesses an experience of excellence. Evertec, as a key partner of Gustazos, has supported us by processing millions of Gustazos deals since 2011. This collaboration offers a long-term benefit for ATH cardholders, Evertec's business partners in Puerto Rico, and for consumers in general.""</em></p><p>The benefits offered by GustitosGo to the merchants that process with Evertec and are registered through <a href=""https://www.getgustitosgo.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">getgustitosgo.com</a> include: their businesses can participate in the program, they will be included in their marketing promotions, and best of all, cardholders will have an added incentive to visit their stores. This will not only help them increase their sales but also to reward their customers' loyalty.</p><p>Users who wish to participate only need to visit <a href=""https://www.gustitosgo.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">gustitosgo.com</a> and link their ATH card; they will automatically start earning rewards whenever they use the linked card to pay at any participating business. Registering in the program is free for cardholders.</p><p>Meanwhile, Evertec will be serving as a data processor and aggregator between the cardholders and the businesses who participate in GustitosGo. Merchants who wish to process with Evertec and benefit from this program can learn more and contact them at <a href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">www.evertecinc.com.</a></p>",,"2021-07-28 10:01:32","evertec-and-social-media-group-gustazos-market-launch-of-gustitos-go","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/WEBgustitos.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.3.1","3.3.4","default","builder",,"a:4:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:7:""divider"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:1;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:5:""style"";a:1:{s:21:""section_divider_style"";a:2:{s:6:""weight"";i:1;s:3:""gap"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i: