"Conoce a una de nuestras líderes: Ana Cristina Vera","33745","<b>En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de género y el desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro éxito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo.<span class=""Apple-converted-space""> </span></b>

<b>ANA CRISTINA VERA </b>es líder de proyectos en Evertec de Medellín.

Es graduada como asesora comercial y financiera con énfasis en atención al cliente. Como parte de su carrera profesional, laboró en el sector financiero e industria por seis años consecutivos. Luego, ingresó a formar parte de Evertec en Medellín (antes Placetopay) donde ejerció como auxiliar comercial durante nueves meses, antes de ser asignada como líder de proyecto.

Al presente, Ana es líder de proyecto y participa en el establecimiento y creación de lo que llamamos proceso de implementación.<span class=""Apple-converted-space"">  </span>Ella lidera dicho proceso con 17 personas a cargo, entre ellos líderes de proyectos e ingeniero de integraciones, con un tiempo total de 5 años y medios.

Ana es una persona apasionada por ayudar y servir de apoyo al otro, siempre en busca de mejorar cada día lo que hace, enfocada en los objetivos y hacia donde quiere ir.

<i>Estamos orgullosos de contar en Evertec con mujeres como Ana, quienes demuestran que nuestro compromiso continuo de asegurar que la diversidad y la inclusión se integren en nuestras prácticas y decisiones de negocio. Compromiso que nos ha llevado a ser incluidos y reconocidos, por cuarta ocasión, en el </i><b><i>Índice de Igualdad de Género de Bloomberg</i></b><i>.</i>","En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de género y el desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro éxito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo. ","2022-03-01 15:25:41","conoce-a-una-de-nuestras-lideres-ana-cristina-vera","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Linkedin-y-Website_Ana-Cristina-ESPANOL.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.4.6","3.4.1","default","builder",,,,,,,,,"Linkedin y Website_Ana Cristina &#8211; ESPANOL",,,,"Linkedin-y-Website_Ana-Cristina-ESPANOL.png","Externos","Bloomberg,Colaboradores,Equidad,Evertec,Evertec Colombia,Igualdad,Índice de Igualdad de Género,líderes,Medellín,Mujeres Líderes",,"es",,"Conoce a una de nuestras líderes: Ana Cristina Vera",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Meet one of our leaders: Ana Cristina Vera","33749","<b>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</b>

<b>ANA CRISTINA VERA </b>is a project leader at Evertec in Medellín.

She graduated with a degree as a commercial and financial advisor with an emphasis in customer service. As part of her professional career, she worked in the financial sector and industry for six consecutive years. Then, she joined Evertec in Medellín (formerly Placetopay) where she worked as a commercial assistant for nine months, before being promoted as project leader.

Currently, Ana is a project leader and takes part establishing and creating what we call the <i>implementation process</i>.  She leads this process with 17 people in charge, including project leaders and integration engineer, with a total time of 5 and a half years.

Ana is a passionate person focused on helping and supporting others, always looking to improve what she does every day, focused on the objectives and where she wants to go.

<i>We are proud to have women like Ana Cristina, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the fourth time in a row, in Bloomberg’s </i><b><i>Gender Equality Index</i></b><i>. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.</i>","En Evertec, estamos comprometidos con la diversidad, equidad de género y el desarrollo de las mujeres. Son rasgos claves de nuestro éxito que nos distingue y llena de orgullo. ","2022-03-01 15:24:22","meet-one-of-our-leaders-ana-cristina-vera","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Linkedin-y-Website_Ana-Cristina-INGLES.png","standard","open","open",,,,,"default",,,,,,,,,,"Linkedin y Website_Ana Cristina &#8211; INGLES",,,,"Linkedin-y-Website_Ana-Cristina-INGLES.png","Externos","Bloomberg,Colaboradores,Collaborators,Equality,Equidad,Evertec,Evertec,Evertec Colombia,Gender Equality Index,Igualdad,Índice de Igualdad de Género,Leaders,líderes,Medellín,Mujeres Líderes,Women Leaders",,"en","Conoce a una de nuestras líderes: Ana Cristina Vera","Meet one of our leaders: Ana Cristina Vera",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"VISA status check messages","33799","<p>Visa no longer allow status check messages of amounts<strong> greater or less than USD 1</strong>, except for transactions at automated fuel dispensers (AFDs) specifically merchants with the Merchant Category Code (MCC) 5542—Automated Fuel Dispensers.</p><p>It is important to use a zero-value account verification messages, instead of using a single unit of currency (i.e., USD 1) or any other amount. This includes the addition of an account number to the customer profile (credential-on-file) and periodic revalidation of stored credentials. </p><p>For this reason:</p><p style=""color: #f36e00; text-align: center; font-size: 30px; line-height: 100%;""><strong>1.</strong></p><p style=""text-align: center;""><strong>We limited</strong> the use of status check authorizations, except for AFD transactions only, and</p><p style=""color: #f36e00; text-align: center; font-size: 30px; line-height: 100%;"">2.</p><p style=""text-align: center;"">It is required to <strong>use only a zero-value</strong> account verification message to verify a customer's account status.</p><h4>QUESTIONS</h4><hr /><p>Email us at <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""mailto:merchantclaims@popularmerchant.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">merchantclaims@popularmerchant.com</a> or call us at 787-773-5150.</p>",,"2022-02-22 14:46:28","visa-status-check-messages","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/tarjeta-visa.webp","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.16.5","3.16.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:4;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:4;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:2:{s:14:""_section_style"";a:1:{s:8:""_padding"";i:2;}s:19:""_section_background"";a:1:{s:22:""_background_background"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s: