"Gustitos™Go, a partnership with many points in its favor ","33809","<p><strong>Gustitos™Go</strong> is a loyalty program created by Gustazos<strong>™</strong> that awards points (G-Credits™) to users registered in the Gustitos Go platform when they pay with their <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.ath.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">ATH<sup>®</sup></a> card at participating businesses. When you make purchases at Gustitos™Go's participating businesses using an <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.ath.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">ATH<sup>®</sup></a> card that is properly registered in the program, you receive G-Credits™ equivalent to 7% of your total purchase. This amount goes up to 12% when you make a second purchase at the same participating business in the same month, as per the participation rules established by <strong>Gustitos™Go</strong>.  G-Credits™ are redeemed at <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""http://www.gustazos.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">www.gustazos.com</a>.</p><p>By belonging to this program, your business will be included in <strong>Gustitos™Go's</strong> marketing promotions and, as the main benefit, cardholders will be encouraged to visit these businesses. This will not only help you boost your sales but will also reward your customers' loyalty.</p><h4>Join now</h4><hr /><p>Cardholders that wish to start earning G-Credits™ should register at <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.gustitosgo.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">www.gustitosgo.com</a>, link their ATH<sup>®</sup> card, and automatically start earning rewards by paying with the linked card at participating businesses and accruing <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.gustazos.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Gustazos.com</a> G-Credits™ for these purchases. Registering in the program is free for cardholders.</p><h4>Register your business</h4><hr /><p>To participate in this program as a merchant, visit <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""https://www.getgustitosgo.com/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">www.getgustitosgo.com</a>, contact your Popular Merchant sales officer, or send us an email at <a style=""color: #f36e21;"" href=""mailto:sales@popularmerchant.com"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">sales@popularmerchant.com</a> stating that you wish to participate in the Gustitos™Go program and including your Merchant ID.</p>",,"2022-02-22 15:18:47","gustitosgo-partnership-with-many-points","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2022/02/GustitosGo-alianza-con-puntos-a-favor.webp","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.16.5","3.16.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","GustitosGo-alianza-con-puntos-a-favor",,,,"GustitosGo-alianza-con-puntos-a-favor.webp","Merchant (boletines)",,"Optional","en","Gustitos™Go una alianza, con muchos puntos a favor","Gustitos™Go, a partnership with many points in its favor ",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
