"Meet one of our leaders: Natalia Salgado","34284","<p><strong>At Evertec, we are committed to diversity, gender equality and the development of women. These are key features of our success that distinguish us and fill us with pride.</strong></p><p>Natalia Salgado is a leader in Evertec’s After Sales Team in Chile.</p><p>Natalia is a commercial engineer, graduated from the Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile. She has more than 15 years of experience in the area of customer service, coordination and service management.</p><p>During her career at Evertec Chile, in 2007 she led the help desk and monitoring teams in the office that Evertec had in Amunategui. In 2013 she moved to Evertec’s headquarters located on London Street to be part of the After-Sales team in charge of the Banco Estado account. In 2020 led the After-Sales area as part of the Customer Service Management and in 2021 she transferred the After-Sales team to the Commercial Management.</p><p>Natalia is a person of solid values, leadership skills, ability to establish communication at all levels, assertive, with great learning capacity, perseverant, practical, proactive, with analytical skills and high orientation to achieve objectives.</p><p>We are proud to have women like Natalia, at Evertec, women who demonstrate and ensure that our ongoing commitment to diversity and inclusion are integrated into our business practices and decisions. This commitment has led us to be recognized and included, for the fourth time in a row, in <strong>Bloomberg’s Gender Equality Index</strong>. At Evertec, we believe that diversity in our workforce is our formula for successful innovation.</p>",,"2022-03-17 11:49:00","meet-one-of-our-leaders-natalia-salgado","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2022/03/Linkedin-y-Website_Natalia-Salgado-INGLES.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.4.6","3.4.1","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""cont