"Department of Antioquia","40911","Citizens are the main focus, which is why strategies have been implemented to ensure that they receive assistance that meets their needs in a timely manner. These strategies also ensure that the community will have access to the entity’s services, providing its users with top-notch benefits.
<h2>The challenge</h2>

<hr />

Looking to improve the quality of the services provided to its citizens, the Antioquia Government has worked hard to obtain tools that offer its citizens more channels to pay their taxes online in a secure manner and protect their confidential information to prevent any potential fraud when conducting this process.
<h2>The solution</h2>

<hr />

With the Evertec PlacetoPay gateway, the Antioquia Government was able to implement a payment button, allowing taxpayers to complete their transactions and pay their taxes online without having to visit the offices. This implementation initially focused on one type of transaction: vehicle taxes, which represent the highest source of revenue for the department to date. Over the years, the feature was used often, and was upgraded to include other services, such as self-disclosures and electronic signatures. This adoption was achieved thanks to the awareness raised and the culture created around online payments and transactions.

This is how the alliance with Evertec has been integral to the organization's digital transformation process, resulting in a synergy that has led to exclusive developments not yet available in through other gateways in Colombia.
<blockquote>“The Antioquia Government has always had a latent need to expand the channels to provide better services to its citizens. Evertec listened to our need and assisted us. This joint effort with other banking entities has allowed us to put together an excellent working team, which is evident when you look at the level of satisfaction among our citizens.”

<cite>Ivon Stella González</cite></blockquote>
<h2>The results</h2>

<hr />

During these 10 years of hard work, the benefits have been significant both for the people and for the Department of Antioquia, whose focus is to meet the requirements that will enable improving their taxpayers' lives.
According to the Department, the greatest benefit has been the improvement in collections. By having more service channels, users find more options to pay their obligations. Additional sources of revenue have also been addressed, such as vehicle taxes, gasoline surcharge taxes, and passports, among others. This has allowed them to reach different sectors of the population by using the proceeds to do more social work.
<h2>Conclusions</h2>

<hr />

<ul>
 	<li style=""list-style-type: none;"">
<ul>
 	<li>Transaction security plays an important role when it comes in providing taxpayers with more options to make payments to the department.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
&nbsp;
<ul>
 	<li style=""list-style-type: none;"">
<ul>
 	<li>Awareness has been raised to help taxpayers overcome their fears and skepticism regarding online payments, helping them understand that having more options benefits both the users and the organization.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
&nbsp;
<ul>
 	<li style=""list-style-type: none;"">
<ul>
 	<li>The Antioquia Government strives to continue improving their relationship with their technological partners to obtain better results. The goal is to bring all of the Department's collections and payments to digital channels, offering taxpayers not only a physical payment method but also the convenience of being able to pay from wherever they are.</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
&nbsp;
<ul>
 	<li>The entity's digital transformation has helped reduce its internal operational burden and costs, which is reflected outwardly in the form of better service delivery and increase in user satisfaction.</li>
</ul>","The Departmental Government of Antioquia is a public entity that handles matters related to the  planning and promotion of the department's economic, political, and social development. It currently employs more than 3,000 people, including employees and contractors, whose primary objective is to improve the social well-being of the people of Antioquia.","2023-02-14 13:34:27","department-of-antioquia","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/Departamento-de-Antioquia.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.10.0","3.10.3","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:1;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","Departamento-de-Antioquia",,,"Departamento de Antioquia","Departamento-de-Antioquia.jpg","Historias de exito",,"Optional","en","Departamento de Antioquia","Department of Antioquia",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"4 beneficios para mi negocio al manejar bien mi inventario","40936","Si estás intentando hacer crecer tu negocio, dale un vistazo a estos cuatro beneficios de manejar bien tu inventario.
<h2>Permite mantener niveles saludables de inventario</h2>
<hr />
Los niveles de inventario en tu negocio deben ser lo suficiente saludables para poder responder en tiempos de incertidumbre, pero no deben ser tan elevados que puedan resultar en costos excesivos de impuestos, o en desperdicio de materiales. ¿Cómo puedes lograr ese balance? La clave es mantener un análisis claro entre las proyecciones de ventas y las ventas realizadas; y entre las órdenes de compra y el inventario en mano. Esto puede sonar complicado, pero hoy día la tecnología puede ayudarte mucho en esta tarea. Por ejemplo, con el punto de venta inteligente de <a style=""color: #ff6600;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/pvot/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener""><u>pvot</u>,</a> podrás visualizar claramente tus ventas realizadas y tus niveles de inventario, y también podrás crear tus órdenes de compra y registrar tus suplidores fácilmente.
<h2>Evita pérdida de inventario</h2>
<hr />
Si no haces el inventario diariamente, al menos una vez al mes debes comparar las cantidades vendidas vs las cantidades que tienes en inventario en tu negocio. El hacer este ejercicio te permitirá evaluar las pérdidas que estás teniendo en tu negocio; ya sea por productos defectuosos, devoluciones o incluso por robo. El llevar un conteo claro de tu inventario te mantendrá informado de cualquier discrepancia o incongruencia imprevista y te permitirá tomar acción lo más rápido posible.
<h2>Brinda visibilidad sobre los costos de tu inventario</h2>
<hr />
Entender los márgenes de ganancia por producto es de suma importancia en el manejo de tu negocio. No necesariamente porque vendas mucho un producto, quiere decir que estás generando suficientes ganancias para hacer crecer tu negocio. Contabilizar lo que compras de inventario y sus costos relacionados, al igual que contabilizar lo que vendes y su margen, te ayudará a maximizar lo que hace tu negocio.
<h2>Ayuda en la toma de decisiones</h2>
<hr />
Como mencionado anteriormente , el producto más vendido no necesariamente es el producto con las mejores ganancias. Además, puede que no te des cuenta que, aunque tu negocio tiene muchas ventas, también estás teniendo muchas pérdidas en inventario. Un buen manejo de inventario y sus costos te dará visibilidad de esos datos claves, y te ayudará en la toma de decisiones. Además, te permitirá llevar unas operaciones saludables y productivas para hacer crecer tu negocio.<strong>¿No tienes todavía un sistema que te ayude con tu manejo de inventario? </strong>Conoce <strong><a style=""color: #ff6600;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/pvot/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener""><u>aquí</u></a></strong> el punto de venta inteligente de pvot.","El manejo de inventario puede sentirse como una tarea titánica para un pequeño negocio, especialmente si no hay empleomanía dedicada para la tarea. No obstante, esta gestión empresarial puede ser un agente catalítico para el éxito de tu empresa.","2023-02-15 13:15:24","4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.10.2","3.10.3","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:1;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario",,,,"pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario.jpg","Artículos",,"Opcional","es",,"4 beneficios para mi negocio al manejar bien mi inventario",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"4 business benefits of good inventory management","40988","<p>If you are trying to grow your business, check out these four benefits of good inventory management.</p><h2>Maintains healthy inventory levels</h2><hr /><p>Your business inventory levels should be healthy enough to respond in times of uncertainty, but not so high that they result in excessive tax costs or wasted materials. How can you strike this balance? The key is to have a clear perspective of the ratio between sale forecasts and actual sales, as well as between purchase orders and on-hand inventory. This may sound complicated, but modern technology could be very helpful with this task. For example, with the <a style=""color: #ff6600;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/en/pvot/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">pvot</a> smart point of sale, you can clearly visualize your actual sales and inventory levels, as well as place purchase orders and register your suppliers easily.</p><h2>Avoids inventory losses</h2><hr /><p>If you do not take inventory on a daily basis, you should compare the quantity sold vs. the quantity on hand in your business at least once a month. This practice will help you evaluate your business's losses due to defective products, returns, or even theft. Maintaining a clear tally of your inventory will keep you informed of any unforeseen discrepancies or inconsistencies and allow you to take action as quickly as possible.</p><h2>Provides insights into your inventory costs</h2><hr /><p>Understanding profit margins by product is of the utmost importance when running your business. Selling a lot does not necessarily mean that you generate enough profits to grow your business. Tracking your inventory purchases and related costs, as well as tracking what you sell and its profit margin, will help you maximize what your business does.</p><h2>Helps your decision-making process</h2><hr /><p>As previously mentioned, the best-selling product is not necessarily the product with the most profits. Besides, even if you are making a lot of sales, you may not notice that your business is also suffering inventory losses. A proper management of your inventory and costs will give you an insight into these key figures and help you in your decision-making processes. It will also allow you to run a healthy and productive operation to grow your business.</p><p><strong>Don't have a system to help with inventory management yet? <a style=""color: #ff6600;"" href=""https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/en/pvot/"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener"">Learn <u>more</u></a></strong> about the pvot smart point of sale.</p>","Inventory management can feel like a herculean task for a small business, especially if there are not enough personnel for the job. However, this administrative process can be a catalyst for your company's success.","2023-02-15 13:15:24","4-business-benefits-of-good-inventory-management","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/02/pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.11.2","3.11.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:1;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario",,,,"pvot-4-beneficios-para-mi-negocio-al-manejar-bien-mi-inventario.jpg","Artículos",,"Optional","en","4 beneficios para mi negocio al manejar bien mi inventario","4 business benefits of good inventory management",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Evertec fortalece sus soluciones de pagos y operaciones en Brasil con la adquisición de paysmart","40995","SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO – 22 de febrero de 2023 - EVERTEC, Inc. (NYSE: EVTC), compañía regional líder de procesamiento de pagos y tecnología, anunció hoy la adquisición de PAYSMART PAGAMENTOS ELETRONICOS (paySmart). paySmart es una Fintech enfocada en el sector financiero y de pagos, que ofrece principalmente servicios de procesamiento, de patrocinio de emisión de tarjetas y soluciones móviles en Brasil.
<blockquote>“Conscientes de lo importante que es el mercado brasileño y de la relevancia que han tomado las Fintechs en el mundo de pagos por su capacidad de innovación y agilidad, la adquisición de paySmart complementa nuestra tecnología y cartera de productos existentes en Brasil acelerando la expansión de nuestra oferta y presencia en este mercado. Nos llena de orgullo dar la bienvenida a Evertec a una empresa como paySmart que comparte nuestra pasión por llevar tecnología de punta y soluciones digitales al ecosistema de pagos”

<cite>Guillermo Rospigliosi
Group Head de Latinoamérica para Evertec.</cite></blockquote>
<blockquote>""Desde que se fundó paySmart, hemos estado trabajando para simplificar el mercado de pagos, ayudando a decenas de empresas a conectarse al ecosistema de pagos global, siempre con un enfoque en ofrecer un excelente servicio, apoyo, agilidad y alto rendimiento. Estamos muy contentos de anunciar este próximo capítulo en la historia de paySmart, ahora como parte de Evertec y entusiasmados con las posibilidades que esto nos trae para impulsar la tecnología de paySmart en América Latina y el mundo, y de aumentar la presencia de Evertec en Brasil”

<cite>Daniel Oliveira
Gerente General de PaySmart</cite></blockquote>
Mediante esta adquisición Evertec expande su presencia en el amplio y creciente mercado de pagos y tecnología financiera de América Latina. Además, fortalece su posición en Brasil, al acercarse aún más al mercado local a través de soluciones ágiles y eficientes para el procesamiento de pagos, complementarias con los productos de procesamiento y prevención de fraude ya presentes en el mercado. paySmart suma a Evertec más de 80 nuevos clientes en el mercado brasilero entre los que se destacan grandes emisores y procesadores de medios de pago, bancos digitales, operadores de tarjetas de beneficios, credenciadores y nuevos jugadores en el ámbito digital.",,"2023-02-22 09:21:45","evertec-fortalece-sus-soluciones-de-pagos-y-operaciones-en-brasil-con-la-adquisicion-de-paysmart","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/paysmart-evertec.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.11.2","3.11.2","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:2;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","paysmart-evertec",,,"Evertec fortalece sus soluciones de pagos y operaciones en Brasil con la adquisición de paysmart","paysmart-evertec.png","Noticias",,"Opcional","es",,"Evertec fortalece sus soluciones de pagos y operaciones en Brasil con la adquisición de paysmart",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Evertec strengthens its payment solutions and operations in Brazil with the acquisition of paySmart","41003","<p>SAN JUAN, PUERTO RICO – February 22, 2023 - EVERTEC, Inc. (NYSE: EVTC), a leading Latin American payment processing and technology company, announced today the acquisition of PAYSMART PAGAMENTOS ELETRONICOS (paySmart). paySmart is a Fintech focused on the financial and payment sector, mainly offering issuer processing services, BIN Sponsorship services and mobile solutions in Brazil.</p>		
					<blockquote>
			<p>
				""Aware of the importance of the Brazilian market and the relevance of Fintech’s in the payments industry, due to their capacity for innovation and agility, the acquisition of paySmart complements our existing technology and product portfolio in Brazil, accelerating the expansion of our offering and presence in this market. Furthermore, we are proud to welcome to Evertec a company like paySmart that shares our passion for bringing cutting-edge technology and digital solutions to the payment ecosystem."" 			</p>
											<cite>Guillermo Rospigliosi<br>Group Head for Latin America for Evertec.</cite>
					</blockquote>
					<blockquote>
			<p>
				""Since paySmart was founded, we have been working to simplify the payments market, helping dozens of companies connect to the global payment ecosystem, always focused on delivering excellent service, support, agility, and high performance. We are excited to announce this next chapter in paySmart's history, now as part of Evertec, and excited about the possibilities this brings us to drive paySmart's technology in Latin America and the world and to increase Evertec's presence in Brazil.""			</p>
											<cite>Daniel Oliveira<br> General Manager for paySmart.</cite>
					</blockquote>
		<p>With the paySmart acquisition, Evertec expands its presence in Latin America's largest and fastest growing financial technology and payments market, Brazil. In addition, it strengthens its position in Brazil, by getting even closer to the local market by offering agile and efficient solutions for payment processing, complementary to the fraud processing and prevention products already present in the market. paySmart adds to Evertec more than 80 new customers in the Brazilian market, including large issuers and payment processors, digital banks, benefit card operators, acquirers and new players in the digital field.</p>",,"2023-02-22 09:21:45","evertec-strengthens-its-payment-solutions-and-operations-in-brazil-with-the-acquisition-of-paysmart","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/03/paysmart-evertec.png","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.12.0","3.12.0","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:2;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","paysmart-evertec",,,"Evertec fortalece sus soluciones de pagos y operaciones en Brasil con la adquisición de paysmart","paysmart-evertec.png","Noticias",,"Optional","en","Evertec fortalece sus soluciones de pagos y operaciones en Brasil con la adquisición de paysmart","Evertec strengthens its payment solutions and operations in Brazil with the acquisition of paySmart",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
"Un compromiso social con la educación","41008","Este evento, que fue creado con el interés de apoyar a jóvenes de escuelas vocacionales que se están desarrollando en programas de artes culinarias, nos brindó la oportunidad de demostrar una vez más el compromiso de responsabilidad social que tiene Evertec por la educación.

Y es que, durante este evento, los jóvenes participantes tuvieron la oportunidad de poder representar a sus escuelas y demostrar sus conocimientos a través de la confección de varios entremeses y postres que fueron degustados por todos los invitados. Como parte de ello, contaron con el apoyo de sus profesores y fueron asesorados por un chef profesional.

Entre las escuelas representadas estaban: la Escuela Ruth E. Cruz Santos de Cidra, Escuela Vocacional Eladio Rivera Quiñones de Loíza, Centro Especial Vocacional Hostos de Puerto Nuevo, Escuela Superior Vocacional Antolín Santos Negrón de Comerío y la Escuela Vocacional William Rivera Betancourt de Canóvanas.   Como parte del evento, ASORE también presentó oficialmente su nueva fundación.

""Fue una experiencia extraordinaria el poder respaldar este tipo de evento. Pudimos ver la entrega de cada estudiante por demostrar su talento y conocer directamente de parte de ellos, los datos especiales de cómo confeccionaron sus platos destacando a su vez el gran conocimiento que han ido adquiriendo. Auspiciar eventos como este nos llena de orgullo porque, no solo va alineado a nuestra responsabilidad social de apoyar la educación, sino que también fomenta el porvenir de los que en un futuro serán los líderes del arte culinario de nuestra isla""
