"A social commitment to education","41021","This event, created with the purpose of supporting young students currently enrolled in culinary arts programs at vocational schools, gave us the opportunity to demonstrate once again Evertec's commitment to social responsibility when it comes to education.

Throughout the event, the young participants had the opportunity to represent their schools and demonstrate their knowledge and expertise by preparing a variety of appetizers and desserts that were sampled by all the attendees. As part of the event, participants had the support of their instructors and received guidance from a professional chef.

