“Being able to support this type of event was an extraordinary experience. We were able to witness each student's determination to show their talent. We also had the chance to learn directly from them about the details of the creation of their dishes, which further highlighted the extensive expertise they have acquired. Sponsoring events like this one fills us with pride. Not only is it something that aligns with our social responsibility to support education; it also promotes a better future for those who will one day be the leaders of our island's culinary industry”
