				<h3>
						Stock Adjustments					
				</h3>
									<p>
						The practice of physically assessing your inventory levels is essential to identify losses due to expired shelf life, defects, theft, or product mismanagement. Daily, weekly, or even monthly inventory monitoring will help you make timely decisions that are key to preventing unnecessary losses.<br><br><br><br>					</p>
				<svg xmlns=""http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"" id=""Capa_1"" data-name=""Capa 1"" viewBox=""0 0 200 200""><defs><style>      .cls-1 {        fill: none;        stroke: #fff;        stroke-miterlimit: 10;        stroke-width: 5px;      }    </style></defs><g><polyline points=""5 71.54 160.95 25.29 174.5 70.97""></polyline><path d=""m38.77,71.5c29.91-8.87,105.53-31.3,105.53-31.3.88,2.97,6.86,8.41,12.68,5.94,2.49,8.25,4.97,16.51,7.46,24.76""></path><line x1=""139.88"" y1=""66.15"" x2=""123"" y2=""71.18""></line><path d=""m79.08,71.79c2.62-2.21,5.74-3.94,9.24-4.97,8.21-2.44,16.68-.57,22.98,4.29""></path></g><g><rect x=""5.05"" y=""71.3"" width=""189.95"" height=""103.41""></rect><path d=""m183.88,151.36c-8.31,1.47-12.47,5.62-13.2,12.71H29.24c-.84-10.76-12.16-12.22-12.16-12.22v-57.94s10.34,0,11.32-11.44h143.02c0,3.62,4.89,11.69,12.22,10.87.08,19.34.16,38.69.24,58.03Z""></path><g><line x1=""41.84"" y1=""110.05"" x2=""66.04"" y2=""110.05""></line><line x1=""33.77"" y1=""123.25"" x2=""65.8"" y2=""123.25""></line><line x1=""42.08"" y1=""136.7"" x2=""65.8"" y2=""136.7""></line></g><g><line x1=""157.84"" y1=""110.05"" x2=""133.64"" y2=""110.05""></line><line x1=""165.91"" y1=""123.25"" x2=""133.88"" y2=""123.25""></line><line x1=""157.6"" y1=""136.7"" x2=""133.88"" y2=""136.7""></line></g><circle cx=""99.9"" cy=""123.62"" r=""29.95""></circle><g><path d=""m89.1,132.44c2.82,5.63,8.45,5.63,8.45,5.63h6.1c4.13,0,7.51-3.38,7.51-7.51h0c0-4.13-3.38-7.51-7.51-7.51h-6.57c-4.13,0-7.51-3.38-7.51-7.51h0c0-4.13,3.38-7.51,7.51-7.51h6.1s5.63,0,8.45,5.63""></path><line x1=""100.37"" y1=""100.52"" x2=""100.37"" y2=""108.03""></line><line x1=""100.37"" y1=""138.08"" x2=""100.37"" y2=""145.59""></line></g></g></svg>				
				<h3>
						Cash Management					
				</h3>
									<p>
						While proper cash management and monitoring are a fundamental part of running a business, it can easily fall through the cracks when handling multiple areas of your business. A solid cash flow report (detailing your cash receipts, disbursements, and deposits) is the only way to guarantee that the money in your business is being handled properly.					</p>
		<p>These are just a few of the indicators used to determine the overall health of a business, from understanding the profitability of your products to getting an accurate assessment of your inventory levels and managing your cash flow. And these reports can be vital for your understanding of what's happening in your business. If you are looking for a point-of-sale solution that generates the reports you need, find out more about <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""/en/pvot/"">pvot here.</a></p>",,"2023-06-14 15:40:30","3-reports-to-monitor-for-your-business","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/06/reportes-que-debo-monitorear-en-mi-negocio.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.13.4","3.13.2","default","builder",,"a:4:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:2;}}}}s:6:""column"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:5;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:12:""_inline_size"";i:5;}}}}s:7:""section"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:6:""layout"";a:1:{s:17:""section_structure"";a:1:{s:9:""structure"";i:1;}}}}s:8:""icon-box"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:3;s:8:""controls"";a:3:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:12:""section_icon"";a:3:{s:13:""selected_icon"";i:3;s:10:""title_text"";i:3;s:16:""description_text"";i:3;}}s:5:""style"";a:2:{s:17:""section_style_box"";a:1:{s:10:""icon_space"";i:1;}s:21:""section_style_content"";a:5:{s:27:""title_typography_typography"";i:3;s:28:""title_typography_font_family"";i:3;s:28:""title_typography_font_weight"";i:3;s:28:""title_typography_line_height"";i:3;s:29:""title_typography_word_spacing"";i:3;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:3:{s:14:""_section_style"";a:1:{s:8:""_padding"";i:3;}s:19:""_section_background"";a:1:{s:22:""_background_background"";i:3;}s:15:""_section_border"";a:3:{s:14:"