"History of Laboratorio Clínico Toledo","52554","<h2>The Challenge</h2><hr /><p>In the complex digital world, saturated with cyber threats, it is crucial to remain vigilant against vulnerabilities, even when we believe we are secure. At Laboratorio Clínico Toledo, we faced the crucial challenge of strengthening the security of our IT infrastructure, especially during nighttime hours. That's when we partnered with Evertec, experts in the field, to implement essential solutions.</p><h2>The Solution</h2><hr /><p>Hand in hand with Evertec, we established a 24/7 monitoring system and an immutable external backup system in an external data center. This solution stood out for its ability to record all events, providing greater reliability in our backups and ensuring the security of our transactions. The benefits of the solution are evident: improved control of our IT assets and a significant reduction in risks. We conduct regular vulnerability scans and work with the Evertec team to assess and address identified vulnerabilities, significantly strengthening our cybersecurity.</p><h2>Results</h2><hr /><p>Thanks to the implementation of Evertec's solutions, we have achieved greater visibility of our IT infrastructure, including servers and firewalls, significantly enhancing efficiency and security throughout the company. Now, whenever a server is created, modified, or logged into, we receive a notification to validate the action. This constant vigilance has provided us with peace of mind, knowing that we are being monitored 24 hours a day, significantly reducing the risk associated with cyber attacks.</p><p>This strategic collaboration with Evertec has transformed our approach to cybersecurity, ensuring safer and more efficient operations for both our staff and clients. We are grateful for the commitment of the Evertec team, which was key to the success of this implementation. Now, our digital assets are safer than ever, allowing us to focus on providing quality services to our clients with complete confidence.</p><p>To learn more about our cybersecurity services, please visit <a style=""color: #ff6c0c;"" href=""/en/cybersecurity/"">www.evertecinc.com/en/cybersecurity/</a></p>","Laboratorio Clínico Toledo is a leader in the healthcare sector in Puerto Rico and the Caribbean. With over 35 years of experience, it is the largest reference laboratory in the region, with the capacity to process up to 98.5% of the tests received. It has a staff of more than 290 employees, 6 branches, and 5 subsidiaries, serving over 1,000 clients.","2023-10-19 14:44:09","history-of-laboratorio-clinico-toledo","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/10/laboratorio-clinico-toledo.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.16.5","3.16.2","default","builder",,"a:2:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:1;}}}}s:9:""container"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","laboratorio-clínico-toledo",,"Historia de éxito Laboratorio Clínico Toledo","Historia de éxito Laboratorio Clínico Toledo","laboratorio-clinico-toledo.jpg","Historias de exito","Evertec,IT infrastructure,laboratorio toledo","Optional","en","Historia de Laboratorio Clínico Toledo","History of Laboratorio Clínico Toledo","At Laboratorio Clínico Toledo, we faced the crucial challenge of strengthening the security of our IT infrastructure, especially during nighttime hours.",,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,"Laboratorio Clínico Toledo",,,,,
