"5 benefits of  self-service equipments or kiosks","56795","<p>Merchant continues to add strategies to transform their businesses, adopting solutions that represent improvements in several aspects. Self-service kiosks are small and efficient equipment that allow your customers to have a simplified and personalized interaction in the purchasing process.</p><p>In this article we highlight five reasons why your business should have a Kiosk:</p><ol><li style=""list-style-type: none;""><ol><li><p><strong>Better user experience</strong></p><p>Agility, security and having everything you need in a single channel is what customers appreciate most when making a transaction. The process may seem faster when they do it themselves, instead of waiting in line or for a cashier to register their purchase.</p></li><li><p><strong>Different Payment Methods</strong></p><p>This device has a modular functionality to support different payment methods including credit cards, ATH, ATH Movil and wallets.</p></li><li><p><strong>User-friendly technology</strong></p><p>Improved efficiency, simplified processes, easy to use and intuitive, high adoption to the technology decreases operational time. In addition, it enables purchase customization and targeted promotions.</p></li><li><p><strong>Reduced operational costs</strong></p><p>Doubling sales and reducing costs are the ideal scenarios for any business, which is why the adoption of new technologies helps to increase productivity and direct efforts to other areas.</p></li><li><p><strong>Effectiveness in processes</strong></p><p>Accelerate order processing, increase productivity in internal business processes, avoid lost sales due to abandonment or service deficiencies. In addition, it integrates all your operations in a single system where you control orders, sales, payments. This automation minimizes human errors in transactions, resulting in more accurate record keeping and inventory management.</p></li></ol></li></ol><p>Explore the new alternatives that technology brings to your business and offer your customer an improved shopping experience. Contact us at sales@popularmerchant.com or call us at (787) 773-5453.</p><p>Consulted from *<a href=""https://www.wiseguyreports.com/reports"">1 WiseGuyReports - El centro de informes de investigación de mercado más grande-Página 1</a><br />*<a href=""https://www.researchandmarkets.com/"">1 Investigación y Mercados - Informes de Investigación de Mercado - Bienvenidos (researchandmarkets.com)</a></p>",""" According to Wise Guy Reports1, the global market for self-service solutions is expected to grow at an average of 3% annually between 2018 and 2025, while Research and Markets2 estimates that payment solutions will move more than US$13 billion globally over the next five years.""","2023-12-19 14:00:30","5-benefits-of-self-service-equipments-or-kiosks","djimenez","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2023/12/kiosks.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.18.2","3.18.1","default","builder",,"a:2:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:2:{s:6:""editor"";i:3;s:12:""text_columns"";i:1;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:1:{s:15:""_section_border"";a:2:{s:14:""_border_radius"";i:1;s:22:""_box_shadow_box_shadow"";i:1;}}}}s:9:""container"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:5:""style"";a:2:{s:18:""section_background"";a:1:{s:21:""background_background"";i:1;}s:14:""section_border"";a:3:{s:13:""border_radius"";i:1;s:26:""box_shadow_box_shadow_type"";i:1;s:21:""box_shadow_box_shadow"";i:1;}}s:8:""advanced"";a:1:{s:14:""section_layout"";a:3:{s:6:""margin"";i:1;s:7:""padding"";i:1;s:11:""css_classes"";i:1;}}}}}",,,,,"a:1:{s:18:""eael_ext_toc_title"";s:19:""Tabla de contenidos"";}","","kiosks",,,,"kiosks.jpg","Artículos","ecommerce,Evertec,seguridad","Optional","en","5 beneficios de los equipos de autoservicio o quio