				<p>
						The power of automation					
				</p>
									<p>
						Retail is an industry with many different phases and processes, many of which can be facilitated and optimized through automated solutions. With various types of process automation at its disposal, retail can benefit greatly in its productivity and operational efficiency, facilitating routine processes that allow it to focus on other key points of the business.					</p>
