"3 Benefits for your business of providing multiple payment options","59820","Here are three reasons why implementing multiple payment channels can be a significant advantage:
<ul id=""eael-feature-list-6500642"">
 	<li>
<h2>Increase the number of customers&lt;/h2 &gt;</h2>
