"Evertec: Ally in planning, protection, and continuity of your business","59875","<p>Every organization, regardless of its size, must anticipate risks and develop a plan to manage and mitigate them. Failing to fulfill this responsibility can have irreparable consequences. Without a business continuity and disaster recovery plan, your operations and services may suffer a partial or complete halt, leading to a chain reaction of negative impacts on your customers, collaborators, suppliers, associates, and, most importantly, your reputation.</p><h2>Evertec protects you from the following:</h2><hr />		
			<ul id=""eael-feature-list-1adc715"">
			                <li>
							<h2							>Financial losses</h2						>
						<p>The interruption of operations can result in severe economic losses, from revenue to additional costs for service recovery.</p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Reputation damages</h2						>
						<p>Customers and partners could lose confidence in the company's ability to offer consistent and reliable services. </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Closing</h2						>
						<p>In extreme cases, the inability to recover from a disaster can lead to the permanent closure of the business.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Loss of critical data</h2						>
						<p>Lack of data backup and recovery can result in the irreversible loss of information essential to business operations.  </p>
					</li>
							</ul>
		<p>Remember that once a customer loses trust in your product or services, it can be difficult to regain.</p><p>The good news is that there are solutions designed to prove that your company is resilient and reliable in the event of any eventuality. At Evertec, we are backed by 20 years of research and development of innovative technology to ensure your business's continuity and mitigate the risks associated with unforeseen events.</p><p>We are committed to protecting your business applications in the event of unexpected outages and offer a disaster recovery center so you can continue operating if disaster strikes.</p><h2>Evertec provides:</h2><hr />		
			<ul id=""eael-feature-list-20d74bb"">
			                <li>
							<h2							>Secure Databases</h2						>
						<p>Data storage, protection, and recovery to ensure your critical information is always available.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Emergency Facilities</h2						>
						<p>Spaces ready to operate during emergencies, ensuring your business can continue operating even in adverse conditions.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Customized Plans</h2						>
						<p>Our certified Continuity Management Institute professionals work with each client to design, develop, and execute a personalized contingency plan tailored to their needs.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>24/7 Support</h2						>
						<p>We ensure that assistance is always available in emergencies.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Hot Site</h2						>
						<p>The facilities have computer systems that allow you to immediately transfer your operation, recover all your data, and restore services.  </p>
					</li>
				                <li>
							<h2							>Cold Site</h2						>
						<p>Alternative facility that provides space for transferring operations and installing computer systems to restore service.  </p>
					</li>
							</ul>
		<p>In short, business continuity and disaster recovery are essential to ensuring an organization's long-term stability and success.</p><p>Evertec offers innovative database solutions and facilities available for operating during emergencies. We provide the support your company needs to face crisis situations. Contact us to explore how Evertec can provide you with peace of mind and uninterrupted operation amidst chaos.  </p>","It's essential to guarantee data access and business continuity, especially during hurricane season.","2024-07-23 13:17:00","evertec-ally-in-plannin-protection-and-continuity-of-your-business","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2024/07/evertec-aliado-en-planificacion.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.23.2","3.23.1","default","builder",,"a:3:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:3;}}}}s:17:""eael-feature-list"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:4;s:8:""controls"";a:2:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:42:""eael_section_feature_list_content_settings"";a:1:{s:17:""eael_feature_list"";i:2;}}s:5:""style"";a:2:{s:36:""eael_section_feature_list_style_icon"";a:6:{s:44:""eael_feature_list_icon_background_background"";i:2;s:39:""eael_feature_list_icon_background_color"";i:2;s:34:""eael_feature_list_icon_circle_size"";i:2;s:27:""eael_feature_list_icon_size"";i:2;s:30:""eael_feature_list_icon_padding"";i:2;s:28:""eael_feature_list_icon_space"";i:2;}s:39:""eael_section_feature_list_style_content"";a:8:{s:36:""eael_feature_list_title_bottom_space"";i:2;s:45:""eael_feature_list_title_typography_typography"";i:2;s:46:""eael_feature_list_title_typography_font_family"";i:2;s:44:""eael_feature_list_title_typography_font_size"";i:2;s:46:""eael_feature_list_title_typography_font_weight"";i:2;s:46:""eael_feature_list_title_typography_line_height"";i:2;s:49:""eael_feature_list_title_typog