		<p>The strategic collaboration between Evertec and Grupo Santander has led to significant milestones that have marked a turning point in the financial industry in Latin America. In 2013, the implementation of the collections hub system for Santander Consumer significantly optimized collection processes. In 2021, one of the most notable achievements was the successful market launch of acquiring services through Getnet. Working hand in hand, Evertec and Grupo Santander challenged the existing ecosystem and diversified the payment processing market in Chile, offering innovative solutions that transformed the financial industry.</p>","Financial technology is crucial in driving economic and social progress in today's globalized world. Evertec and Grupo Santander have formed a strategic partnership that has reshaped the financial landscape in Latin America for over 25 years. Since their collaboration began in 1996, they have introduced innovations that have greatly improved the efficiency and security of payment processing, electronic transactions, and ATM management.","2024-04-12 16:11:04","evertec-and-grupo-santander-transforming-financial-experience-in-latin-america","cmoya","publish","https://dev.creativeteam.co/evertest/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/getnet.jpg","standard","open","open",,"wp-post","3.25.10","3.25.4","default","builder",,"a:4:{s:11:""text-editor"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:3;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:1:{s:7:""content"";a:1:{s:14:""section_editor"";a:1:{s:6:""editor"";i:3;}}}}s:9:""container"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:2;s:15:""control_percent"";i:0;s:8:""controls"";a:0:{}}s:15:""eael-data-table"";a:3:{s:5:""count"";i:1;s:15:""control_percent"";i:3;s:8:""controls"";a:3:{s:7:""content"";a:2:{s:30:""eael_section_data_table_header"";a:1:{s:32:""eael_data_table_header_cols_data"";i:1;}s:31:""eael_section_data_table_cotnent"";a:1:{s:28:""eael_data_table_content_rows"";i:1;}}s:5:""style"";a:3:{s:38:""eael_section_data_table_style_settings"";a:1:{s: