"FinanCard launches its new digital wallet linked to a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec","64360","<p>Seeking to expand access to financial services in Panama, Financiera FinanCard has launched EASI by Financard, a digital wallet associated with a prepaid Mastercard processed by Evertec. This innovative tool allows users to easily reload funds, make purchases at physical and online merchants, make recurring charges and transfer money instantly to other users within the application.</p>
