"Placetopay by Evertec: Now with ACH Payment Processing","64701","<h2>What is Placetopay, and<br />
how can it transform your business?</h2>
<hr />
<p>Placetopay is a digital payment platform that enables secure and efficient handling of electronic transactions from any device or channel. Designed for merchants, it simplifies accepting online payments without needing a website.</p>
